  "description": "Bulud.Security.InMemoryOtp is a lightweight .NET library providing an in-memory\n            implementation of OTP (One-Time Password) service for Bulud.Base interfaces.\n            Features include:\n            - Generate and validate OTP codes in memory\n            - Fully compatible with Bulud.Base interfaces\n            - Simple and fast for testing or lightweight applications\n            - Easy integration with .NET DI",
